TI  - The Polarization-Index: A Simple Calculation to Distinguish Polarized From Non-polarized Training Intensity Distributions
T2  - FRONTIERS IN PHYSIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - high-intensity training
KW  - high-performance sports
KW  - lactate threshold training
