TI  - Amateur Rowers to Transatlantic Trio Race Winners: A Case Study Describing the Physiological and Psychological Characteristics, Training Adaptations and Race Responses to Ultra-Endurance Rowing
T2  - EUROPEAN JOURNAL OF SPORT SCIENCE
LA  - English
