TI  - Ventilatory support during whole-body row training improves oxygen uptake efficiency in patients with high-level spinal cord injury: A pilot study
T2  - RESPIRATORY MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - Spinal cord injury
KW  - Non-invasive ventilation
KW  - Rehabilitation
KW  - Oxygen uptake efficiency
KW  - Hybrid FES rowing
KW  - AEROBIC CAPACITY
