TI  - UCI Sports Nutrition Project: Does Cycling Create a "Perfect Storm for Bone Health? Cycling-Specific Challenges to Bone and Nutritional Strategies to Overcome These "
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORT NUTRITION AND EXERCISE METABOLISM
LA  - English
