TI  - Acute Hormonal and Force Responses to Combined Strength and Endurance Loadings in Men and Women: The "Order Effect"
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - HEAVY-RESISTANCE EXERCISE
KW  - GROWTH-HORMONE
KW  - IGF-I
KW  - NEUROMUSCULAR PERFORMANCE
KW  - CONCURRENT ENDURANCE
