TI  - Intrinsic sinus and atrioventricular node electrophysiologic adaptations in endurance athletes
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN COLLEGE OF CARDIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
KW  - NERVOUS-SYSTEM
