TI  - Do Olympic Athletes Train as in the Paleolithic Era?
T2  - SPORTS MEDICINE
LA  - English
KW  - SKELETAL-MUSCLE ADAPTATION
KW  - ENDURANCE EXERCISE
KW  - PHYSICAL-ACTIVITY
KW  - HUNTER-GATHERER
