TI  - Association of fat-free mass and training status with left ventricular size and mass in endurance-trained athletes
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE AMERICAN COLLEGE OF CARDIOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - BODY-SIZE
KW  - BLOOD-PRESSURE
