TI  - Is a Head-Worn Inertial Sensor a Valid Tool to Monitor Swimming?
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF SPORTS PHYSIOLOGY AND PERFORMANCE
LA  - English
KW  - training
KW  - stroke count
KW  - wearable device
KW  - SESSION-RPE
