TI  - Twenty-Four-Hour Low Energy Availability Induced by Diet or Exercise Exhibits Divergent Influences on Sleep and Recovery Indices among Female and Male Cyclists
T2  - MEDICINE & SCIENCE IN SPORTS & EXERCISE
LA  - English
KW  - ATHLETES
KW  - HEART RATE VARIABILITY
KW  - LEA
KW  - REDS
KW  - SEX DIFFERENCES
