TI  - Daily heart rate variability of Paralympic gold medallist swimmers: A 17-week investigation
T2  - JOURNAL OF SPORT AND HEALTH SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - Autonomic nervous system
KW  - Cardiac modulation
KW  - Disability
