TI  - Reserve capabilities of the cardiorespiratory system in athletes of certain sports under conditions of intense muscular activity
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF BIOLOGY AND CHEMISTRY
LA  - English
KW  - athletes
KW  - health assessment
KW  - physical performance
KW  - endurance
