TI  - The Use of Portable NIRS to Measure Muscle Oxygenation and Haemodynamics During a Repeated Sprint Running Test
T2  - OXYGEN TRANSPORT TO TISSUE XXXV
LA  - English
CP  - 40th Annual Meeting of the International-Society-on-Oxygen-Transport-to-Tissue (ISOTT)
