TI  - Aerobic Cycling Exercise Training Does Not Improve Impaired Vagal Reactivation in Patients with Chronic Kidney Disease
T2  - MEDICINE & SCIENCE IN SPORTS & EXERCISE
LA  - English
KW  - CHRONIC KIDNEY DISEASE
