TI  - Associations between Acute and Chronic Effects of Exercise on Indicators of Metabolic Health: A Pilot Training Trial
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - CARDIOVASCULAR RISK-FACTORS
KW  - MUSCLE GLUCOSE-TRANSPORT
