TI  - EVALUATION OF THE EFFECTS OF A TRAINING PROGRAMME FOR PATIENTS WITH PROLONGED FATIGUE ON PHYSIOLOGICAL PARAMETERS AND FATIGUE COMPLAINTS
T2  - INTERNATIONAL JOURNAL OF OCCUPATIONAL MEDICINE AND ENVIRONMENTAL HEALTH
