TI  - Effects of Hydrogen-Rich Water Supplementation on Exercise Performance, Autonomic Nervous System Recovery, and Blood Lactate Concentration During Repeated Sprint Exercise in Male University Athletes
T2  - JOURNAL OF SPORTS SCIENCE AND MEDICINE
LA  - English
