TI  - Effects of weight changes in the autonomic nervous system: A systematic review and meta-analysis
T2  - CLINICAL NUTRITION
LA  - English
KW  - Autonomic nervous system
KW  - Weight change
KW  - Heart rate variability
KW  - Muscle sympathetic nerve activity
