TI  - Intermittent aerobic-resistance interval training versus continues aerobic training: Improvement in cardiac electrophysiologic and anthropometric measures in male patients post myocadiac infarction, a randomized control trial
T2  - PLOS ONE
LA  - English
KW  - HEART-RATE-VARIABILITY
KW  - ATRIAL-FIBRILLATION
