TI  - Oscillatory patterns in heart rate variability and complexity: A meta-analysis
T2  - BIOMEDICAL SIGNAL PROCESSING AND CONTROL
LA  - English
KW  - Heart rate variability
KW  - Heart rate complexity
KW  - Oscillatory pattern
